    "title": "Does not having a spring transfer portal window affect Alex Golesh's coaching? - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Peter Rauterkus ,\n1 days ago While having an extra chance to add players never hurts in college football, Alex Golesh is relieved to not have a spring transfer portal window to worry about this year. The spring portal was eliminated when the NCAA moved to a single 15-day window in January this year, a move that Golesh joked was better for his mental health. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
